{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">秀茂坪有私家車撞向停在路邊的泥頭車，私家車司機涉醉駕被捕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事私家車左邊車頭嚴重損毀，泥頭車右邊車尾防撞杆受損。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.SMP-0100_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026dfK788TlIT1786662266.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.SMP-0100_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事私家車在昨晚十一時許沿安秀道往西貢方向行駛期間，撞向停在左邊路邊的泥頭車。65歲男司機沒有受傷，毋須送院。他未能通過酒精呼氣測試，涉嫌酒後駕駛被捕，警方調查事故原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T23:19:04.441875+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}